      "views": [
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**Trollamine** is TrollStore and Dopamine in one app. The installer downloads the latest official Dopamine and builds Trollamine right on your device. No TrollStore needed to get started.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "What you get"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Dopamine's look and layout, blended with TrollStore's, in a blue-into-green theme.\n- A TrollStore-style **Apps** panel, opened from the main menu, that installs apps for you (including Dopamine itself).\n- ldid is installed automatically when an app needs it.\n- Jailbreak detection that works across jailbreaks, not only Dopamine.\n- When jailbroken, the Jailbreak button becomes **Reboot to Remove Jailbreak**, with a fast userspace reboot or a full reboot.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "How to use"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "1. Install **Trollamine Installer** from Cobalt.\n2. Open it from the Home Screen while connected to the internet.\n3. Let it download Dopamine and build Trollamine.\n4. Open Trollamine when it finishes.",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
